Heroes III: Shattered Realms

A mythology-first expansion for VCMI.

Five original factions:
- Crimson Court — Blood Elves and ritual blood magic
- Abyss — eldritch beings from beneath reality
- Veil — Dreamborn entities from the world of dreams
- Hollow — a forsaken court trapped between life and death
- Starfall — mythic celestial beings and sacred geometry

v0.1 is a development build focused on the Crimson Court vertical slice.
